<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>A few notes first</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand-harbor/harbor-tab-icon.png">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-oat:           #e8e0cd;
      --color-clay:          #b89683;
      --color-ink-brown:     #3a2f24;
    }
    html, body {
      margin: 0; padding: 0;
      background: var(--color-oat);
      color: var(--color-ink-brown);
      font-family: 'Tiempos Text', 'Iowan Old Style', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }
    main { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 28px; }
    h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 18px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; }
    h2 { font-size: 18px; margin: 28px 0 8px; font-weight: 600; }
    p { line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px; }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(184, 150, 131, 0.35);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px 28px;
      margin: 18px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: var(--color-ink-brown);
      color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/_harbor-skip-link') %>
<main id="main">
  <h1>A few notes first.</h1>
  <p>The review of your draft left a few small things to address before your website is ready to make public.</p>
  <% if (notes) { %>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Notes</h2>
      <p style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><%= notes %></p>
    </div>
  <% } %>
  <p>Talk with Haven in <a href="/lighthouse/table">your conversation</a> about how you would like to address these. Once they are taken care of, the "Make this public" option opens up.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="/lighthouse/table">Go to your conversation</a>
  </p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
